 ---
  Server (FastAPI + Python)

  cd /Volumes/Seagate/Parth/server
  source venv/bin/activate         # activate virtual env
  uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 --reload

  Or without --reload for production-style:
  uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
  
  Prerequisites: Ollama must be running locally (default model: gemma3:12b). Optionally set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY for Krishna Oracle.

  ---
  Client (Flutter)
  
  cd /Volumes/Seagate/Parth/app
  flutter pub get          # first time only
  flutter run              # picks a connected device/emulator

  For a specific target:
  flutter run -d chrome    # web
  flutter run -d macos     # desktop
  flutter run -d <device>  # mobile — list with: flutter devices
